message: "If you use this framework, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "SIDE Framework: Structural Inversion Detection through Enquiry"
authors:
  - family-names: Nakatsugawa
    given-names: Masahiro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3224-0103"
abstract: >-
  A diagnostic framework for uncovering hidden misalignments of responsibility, authority
  and structure in organizations, based on four questions: who should be doing this, do they
  have the authority or tools to act, is the relationship appropriate, and is the
  misalignment structural or incidental. Useful for spotting early signs of dysfunction in
  Agile, digital transformation and OKR settings.
